GENERATED ARTIFACTS

Some files in this repository, and some produced when building it, are
generated from covered sources. They are derivative works of those
sources and are distributed under the same terms, whether or not they
carry an individual notice.

  - Protocol Buffer output (pkg/proto/*.pb.go) is generated by
    protoc-gen-go from the .proto files in this repository. It carries
    the Exhibit A notice, because protoc-gen-go propagates the leading
    comment of its input.

  - Python binding output under adk/python/gapi/native/ is generated by
    gopy at build time and is NOT tracked in this repository. It carries
    no individual notice: gopy stamps its own generated-file header and
    rewrites the files on every build, so any notice added by hand would
    not survive. This paragraph is what places that output under the
    MPL 2.0, and it applies to any artifact redistributed from it -
    a Python wheel or sdist built from this repository included.

Generated files are exempt from the per-file header gate by design; a
notice a build step overwrites is worse than an honest tree-level
statement, because it looks maintained and is not.
